0 @H1@ NOTE
1 CONC I am Michael Amin Farah from Nazareth.
1 CONT
1 CONT Hours were spent to compile this file. However, it is by no 
1 CONC meanscomplete. I have listed the people whom I remember and when I was 
1 CONC notsure, I did not write any name, so you will find people missing. 
1 CONC Thefemales were never included in our old family trees and this is 
1 CONC thefirst time they get included, so I only added the ones I know 
1 CONC andhence many females are not included yet.
1 CONT
1 CONT You can help complete this family tree by joining our facebook 
1 CONC group:FARAH FAMILY 
1 CONC WORLDWIDE:https://www.facebook.com/groups/thefarahfamily/ . I am one 
1 CONC of theadmins, you can contact me and send me more information to 
1 CONC completethis family tree.
1 CONT
1 CONT Thanks for your cooperation. Keep this piece of history updated 
1 CONC andshow it to your family.
